SOURCE CORRECTION
-----------------
Christian Bagshaw, "Geometric Constructions of Quadratic Number Fields with
High p-Rank", University of Calgary Undergraduate Honours Thesis, April 2021,
printed pp. 26-27 (PDF pp. 27-28), reports that the Schoof/Mestre family

  M(t)=-(t^2+t+1)
        (47t^6+21t^5+598t^4+1561t^3+1198t^2+261t+47)

produced 8,382,903 fields for coprime 1 <= numerator,denominator <= 4000:

  5-rank 1: 1,581,624
  5-rank 2: 5,285,449
  5-rank 3: 1,502,796
  5-rank 4:    13,029
  5-rank 5:         5

The five reported rank-five discriminants are listed in printed Table 3.2.
The first is

  D=23454009318604054148884180799, t=477/1694,
  reported 5-primary exponents=(2,1,1,1,1).

Source PDF:
  https://web.maths.unsw.edu.au/~cbagshaw/Honours_Thesis.pdf

PARI DISCOVERY AUDIT
