BOUNDARY
--------
This is the corrected published/exact 5-frontier, but it earns no challenge
credit: the first requested 5-rank is six.  Bagshaw's same experiment found
no rank-six row, and its p=7 family topped out at rank three.  The separate
2024 norm-equation search supplies the exact 7-rank-four control already in
the repository.  Neither negative finite search is an impossibility result.
